      "type": "grammar",
      "title": "……的时候: when …",
      "body": "To say 'when (something happens)', put the action first, then add 的时候. The 'when' part always comes before the main part of the sentence. You can use it with actions (吃饭的时候) or descriptions (忙的时候).",
